[
  {
    "_comment": "CAPABILITY suite for the PostgreSQL connector, via `--type connectors/oracle.json`. Functions in functions/caps_oracle.py. SOURCE (`oracle_in`, reads existing oracle_world_xs seed): base (3 queries), _inc (watermark paging — re-run to walk 10 rows/trigger), _none (WHERE 1=0), _multiquery (2 queries, transactional=False). DEST (`oracle_out`, input from dev datagen `caps_input/cap_rows`): _append (create then accumulate) and _replace (create then DROP+recreate; row count stays) writing to distinct tables cap_append/cap_replace; re-run `suite.py run` to observe append-grows vs replace-stays. PostgreSQL has no schema evolution. Domains: dev (datagen), oracle_world_xs (source), oracle (dest). SRC METADATA: oracle_meta_keep and oracle_meta_drop (oracle_in) read the same one-query SELECT with and without the `tabsdata.src_metadata.drop` src_cfg key, and one transformer each in collection oracle_meta (group ops) asserts that side: oracle_meta_keep_check that the `@td.sql.query` and `@td.sql.initial_values` metadata columns are there plus exactly the expected data columns, oracle_meta_drop_check that no `@td.` column is left and the data columns are unchanged (functions/_srcmeta.py — which also explains why ONE transformer over both tables cannot work: an input reference puts the function in the producing plan, so it would run in each publisher's plan with the other's table missing)."
  },
  {
    "domain-manifest": {
      "domains": [
        {
          "name": "${xp_name(dev)}",
          "system": "dev",
          "model": null,
          "data": null
        },
        {
          "name": "${xp_name(oracle_world_xs)}",
          "system": "oracle",
          "model": "world",
          "data": "xs"
        },
        {
          "name": "${xp_name(oracle)}",
          "system": "oracle",
          "model": null,
          "data": null
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "collections": [
      {
        "name": "caps_input",
        "type": "datagen_in",
        "connection_template": "connection-file:connections/datagen_in.yaml",
        "group": "sources",
        "domains": {
          "D0": "${xp_name(dev)}"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "oracle_in",
        "type": "oracle_sql_in",
        "connection_template": "connection-file:connections/oracle_sql_in.yaml",
        "group": "sources",
        "domains": {
          "D0": "${xp_name(oracle_world_xs)}"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "oracle_out",
        "type": "oracle_sql_out",
        "connection_template": "connection-file:connections/oracle_sql_out.yaml",
        "group": "destinations",
        "domains": {
          "D0": "${xp_name(oracle)}"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "oracle_meta",
        "type": "transform",
        "group": "ops"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "functions": [
      {
        "collection": "caps_input",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_datagen.py::caps_rows"
      },
      {
        "collection": "oracle_in",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_oracle.py::oracle_in"
      },
      {
        "collection": "oracle_in",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_oracle.py::oracle_in_inc"
      },
      {
        "collection": "oracle_in",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_oracle.py::oracle_in_none"
      },
      {
        "collection": "oracle_in",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_oracle.py::oracle_in_multiquery"
      },
      {
        "collection": "oracle_out",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_oracle.py::oracle_out_append"
      },
      {
        "collection": "oracle_out",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_oracle.py::oracle_out_replace"
      },
      {
        "collection": "oracle_out",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_oracle.py::oracle_out_none"
      },
      {
        "collection": "oracle_in",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_oracle.py::oracle_meta_keep"
      },
      {
        "collection": "oracle_in",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_oracle.py::oracle_meta_drop"
      },
      {
        "collection": "oracle_meta",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_oracle.py::oracle_meta_keep_check"
      },
      {
        "collection": "oracle_meta",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_oracle.py::oracle_meta_drop_check"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "triggers": [
      {
